WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:21.523
"What a great day," said Kip.

2
00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:24.529
"The sun is bright.

3
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.233
And there are no clouds!"

4
00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:35.925
Boomph! A big acorn landed next to Kip.

5
00:00:35.926 --> 00:00:39.869
The acorn was round and shiny.

6
00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.710
Kip picked up the acorn and smiled.

7
00:00:42.711 --> 00:00:46.410
"This acorn is perfect," he said.

8
00:00:46.411 --> 00:00:55.431
"What a great day!"

9
00:00:55.432 --> 00:01:05.113
Kip walked back toward his tree.

10
00:01:05.114 --> 00:01:08.158
"That's a nice acorn," said Squirrel.

11
00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:13.671
"Thanks," said Kip.

12
00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:16.749
"Pretty acorn," said Mouse.

13
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.487
"Thanks," said Kip.

14
00:01:20.488 --> 00:01:29.778
"I'm having a great day!"

15
00:01:29.779 --> 00:01:36.328
Kip walked across the bike path.

16
00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:40.118
"What a great day," said Kip.

17
00:01:40.119 --> 00:01:42.649
"The sun is bright.

18
00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.358
There are no clouds.

19
00:01:45.359 --> 00:01:48.603
And I found the best—oof!"

20
00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:51.487
Kip tripped over a stick.

21
00:01:51.488 --> 00:01:53.899
He dropped the acorn.

22
00:01:53.900 --> 00:02:04.097
The acorn rolled away.

23
00:02:04.098 --> 00:02:07.219
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

24
00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:10.489
Kip dived for the acorn.

25
00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.944
But he was too slow.

26
00:02:13.945 --> 00:02:20.119
The acorn was gone!
